Design Philosophy

The platform must be:

Local First

Company information should remain local whenever possible.

The system should support:

Local LLMs
Local vector databases
Local document storage

Cloud services should only be used when beneficial.

Human In The Loop

The AI must never:

Send emails
Modify official documents
Change company records
Create regulatory submissions

without explicit user approval.

All external actions should require approval workflows.

Explainable

The assistant must:

Cite sources
Show reasoning steps
Provide references
Track where information originated

No black-box answers.

Modular

All major functionality should be implemented as independent modules.

Examples:

Email module
Calendar module
Knowledge module
Research module
Regulatory module
Investor module
QMS module
Task module

Modules should be independently replaceable.

